# spec: SETGET [1.2] on the 700 sends the name as UTF-8 with no flag byte; the 700 answers STATUS with a 00 byte and the new name, twice in one read.
# source: NC 700 fw 1.8.2-11524+e0f7590, bosectl on Linux (BlueZ), notifications on (NOTES.md, NC 700 section)
device nc700
call set_name Test 700
send 01 02 02 08 54 65 73 74 20 37 30 30
recv 01 02 03 09 00 54 65 73 74 20 37 30 30 01 02 03 09 00 54 65 73 74 20 37 30 30
result ok
